{"title":"Products","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"collar-power-bank","title":"Collar Power Bank","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Collar Power Bank is a 2850 mAh battery designed specifically for Vuzix Smart Glasses. It offers ten times the battery capacity of Blade Smart Glasses for 10 hours of run time under normal operation. The battery is worn around the neck to comfortably and conveniently extend device usage. It also provides pass-through audio from the Vuzix Blade Model 447 to headphones. Note: Vuzix Blade Model 494 cannot use the pass-through audio.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40865740062886,"sku":"447T0A006","price":99.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/Product_Image_Vuzix_Accessories_collar1.png?v=1628086943"},{"product_id":"vuzix-blade-sunglasses-clip-on","title":"Vuzix Blade™ Sunglasses Clip-on","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTAC polarized lenses are thinner than ordinary PC or AC lenses, only about 0.74mm in thickness but more durable and flexible than ordinary PC or AC lenses. Normal sunglasses lenses can only reduce sunlight, but polarized lenses can reduce the glare from sunlight, especially the glare from the surface of roads, lakes and windows. These rimless clip on sunglasses are designed to fit over the Vuzix Blade, and flip up when you don't need them.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUV-400 Lenses provide 100% UV protection and anti-glare from sunlight.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Specifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eClip Material: Metal \u0026amp; TR90 plastic; Lens Material: UV400 TAC polarized; Lens Size: 60x40mm(2.36x1.57 in).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eIncludes 1 polarized clip-on sunglasses, 1 cleaning cloth, 1 PVC case.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWarnings:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eDo not look directly at the sun. Do not use while driving at night.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40865740521638,"sku":"447T0A005","price":24.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/Vuzix_Blade_Sunglasses_Clip_on.jpg?v=1628086949"},{"product_id":"m-series-safety-frame-mounting-clips","title":"M-Series Safety Frame Mounting Clips (L\u0026R)","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eReplacement mounting clips (frame not included) for attaching to M-Series lensless frames. Set includes left and right side clips with the custom Vuzix rail mounting system, allowing for right or left eye mounting with 30 degree rotation of the main M-Series Smart Glasses.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40865740587174,"sku":"446T0A006","price":19.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/M_series_safety_frame_mounting_clips.jpg?v=1628086950"},{"product_id":"headset-mount-peltor","title":"Headset Mount, Peltor","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFor very noisy environments, this adaptor for the 3M Peltor WS LiteCom headset provides a stable mounting of the M-Series Smart Glasses main unit and its battery. Includes both the left and right side mounts.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40865740751014,"sku":"446T0A029","price":19.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/3M_Headset_Mount_Peltor.jpg?v=1684273053"},{"product_id":"m-series-ear-hooks","title":"M-Series Ear Hooks (For Lens-Less Frames)","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eReplacement ear-hooks for the M-Series Lensless Frames provide a customized snug fit for all head sizes, stabilizing the frames on the head and preventing slippage when using in a head down position.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40865741668518,"sku":"446T0A019","price":9.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/M_Series_Ear_Hooks.jpg?v=1628086968"},{"product_id":"m400-usb-a-to-usb-ccharging-cable-1-meter","title":"Vuzix M400™ USB-A to USB-C Charging Cable 1 meter","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eUSB-A to USB-C Viewer Cable is a 1 meter cable designed to charge an M-Series Power Bank from a laptop or wall adapter (not included).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40865741897894,"sku":"472T0A004","price":19.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/M400_USB_A_to_USB_C_Charging_Cable_1meter.jpg?v=1628086970"},{"product_id":"m400-usb-c-to-usb-c-viewer-cable-16-inch","title":"Vuzix M400™ USB-C to USB-C Viewer Cable 16\"","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUSB-C to USB-C Viewer Cable is a 16\" cable designed to run an M-Series device with its included Power Bank.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40865742028966,"sku":"472T0A003","price":24.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/M400_USB_C_to_USB_C_Viewer_Cable_16inc.jpg?v=1628086971"},{"product_id":"m-series-safety-helmet-mounts","title":"M-Series Safety Helmet Mounts (L\u0026R)","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eThe M-Series Safety Helmet Mounts include both left and right side mounts that attach to the standard accessory mounting slots on either side of the helmet. Mounts allow for 30 degree rotation of Smart Glasses and fit most standard US and EU safety helmets. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eHelmet not included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40865742225574,"sku":"446T0A007","price":19.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/M-Series-Safety-Helmet-Mounts.png?v=1628086973"},{"product_id":"m-series-safety-frame-kit-prescription-ready","title":"M-Series Safety Frame Kit (Prescription Ready)","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eM-Series safety frames include left and right side clips with the custom Vuzix rail mounting system, allowing for right or left eye mounting with 30 degree rotation of the M-Series Smart Glasses main unit. Shipped with prescription blanks, these frames can be fitted for safety rated prescriptions by most optometrists. Additional accessories include a comfort nose bridge, dust guard, and temple head strap for a snug fit.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e \u003cem\u003eSmart Glasses not included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Small","offer_id":40865743569062,"sku":"446T0A022","price":29.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Medium","offer_id":40865743601830,"sku":"446T0A001","price":29.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Large","offer_id":40865743634598,"sku":"446T0A023","price":29.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/M-Series-Safety-Frame-Kit.png?v=1628086990"},{"product_id":"m-series-lens-less-frames","title":"M-Series Lensless Frames","description":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp id=\"product-description\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eReplacement frames can accommodate both the M-Series Smart Glasses and M-Series On-Frame Battery for either right or left eye mounting via the custom Vuzix rail mounting system on both temples. Designed with an adjustable tall nose bridge and no lenses, these frames allow the user to wear them over most pairs of prescription or safety eyewear. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eSmart Glasses not included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40865744126118,"sku":"446T0A010","price":59.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/access.png?v=1628086993"},{"product_id":"m400-smart-glasses","title":"Vuzix M400™ Smart Glasses","description":"\u003cdiv data-region=\"main\" data-shogun-power-up-id=\"\" data-shogun-power-up-type=\"\" data-shogun-page-type=\"product\" data-shogun-variant-id=\"66a94c70693e618d7ec2db6e\" data-shogun-platform-type=\"shopify\" data-shogun-page-version-id=\"66a94c6f693e618d7ec2d2cd\" data-shogun-page-id=\"61683a0f12180e00e8072c7d\" data-shogun-site-id=\"85aa81c4-d7e3-4cf8-be8d-146bd5bdf5ab\" data-shogun-id=\"61683a0f12180e00e8072c7d\" class=\"shogun-root\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"shg-c\" id=\"s-969f7203-f82d-432b-832e-bf61988860d3\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"shg-rich-text shg-theme-text-content\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe lightest, most comfortable smart glasses specifically designed for all day wear\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExpansive OLED panel display and auto-focus camera with built-in scanner\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHigh performance Qualcomm XR1 processor\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLong-life hot swapable batteries for zero downtime\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoice control with 29 supported languages\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLeft or right eye use with a variety of mounting options\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtended Wear\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eM400 main unit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e4800 mAh USB-C power bank + power cable (not IP67 certified)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003eHeadband\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003eSafety Frames\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eOne-year manufacturer’s warranty\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"M400 Xtreme","offer_id":45726510743718,"sku":"472T00027","price":1499.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"M400 Extended Wear","offer_id":41517448659110,"sku":"472T00028","price":1499.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/M400_Xtreme_Kit1048-color_bca05364-14f8-4941-ba31-0dec3f104c19.jpg?v=1723565839"},{"product_id":"vuzix-blade-2-smart-glasses-prescription-inserts","title":"Vuzix Blade 2™ Smart Glasses Prescription Inserts","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eSingle-Vision Prescriptions Only\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDo it yourself Kit to change the lenses on your Blade. Comes with manufactured lenses made from your prescription.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAfter you purchase your lenses, please fill out \u003ca rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/EyehubSolutions.formstack.com\/forms\/prescription\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ethis form\u003c\/a\u003e with your prescription information.\u003c\/strong\u003e Once we receive your prescription information, we will fulfill your order. If you have any questions, please contact us \u003ca href=\"mailto:christian_powell-byars@vuzix.com\"\u003ehere\u003c\/a\u003e. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eTo learn how to install your new prescription lenses on your Blade, view our installation guide on the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"Blade 2 Prescription Installation Guide\" href=\"\/pages\/blade-2-prescription-lens-installation-guide-1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBlade 2 Prescription Installation Guide\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e page.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e* Prescription kit does not come with Vuzix Blade Upgraded Smart Glasses. Vuzix Blade Upgraded Smart Glasses will need to be added separately.\u003cu\u003e\u003c\/u\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003c\/u\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 30px;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e* The Prescription Kit will be shipped within 4-6 weeks of your order date. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Vuzix Blade Smart Glasses and Prescription Kit Inserts will be shipped to you in 2 separate shipments.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca title=\"Prescription Lens Installation Guide\" href=\"https:\/\/vuzix-shop.myshopify.com\/pages\/prescription-measurement-guide\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFind Out How To Enter Your Prescription\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40865971044518,"sku":"447T0A007","price":149.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/Product_Image_Product_Image_Product_Image_Blade_prescription_lenses_cf21a87e-4c8c-4a2f-ba2c-4e9d81808c1a.png?v=1628088915"},{"product_id":"m-series-headband","title":"M-Series Headband","description":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAdjustable Headband fits any head size comfortably while providing a stable mounting of the M-Series Smart Glasses. Elastic headband is lined for comfort, and holds an M-Series On-Frame Battery mount on one side and a single custom Vuzix rail mount on the other side, allowing for left or right eye use.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSmart Glasses not included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41738877862054,"sku":"446T0A002","price":49.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/ScreenShot2021-11-18at9.04.57AM.png?v=1637247950"},{"product_id":"hat-mount","title":"M-Series Hat Mount","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eM-Series Hat Mounts are designed for comfort and versatility. They fit most baseball caps, visors, and safety bump caps providing a stable mounting for M-Series Smart Glasses. They can hold several M-Series On-Frame Battery types on one side and a single custom Vuzix rail mount on the other. The mounts rotate 360 degrees allowing use of M-Series Smart Glasses with either the left or right eye.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43111750434982,"sku":"446T0A038","price":19.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/ScreenShot2022-07-15at10.17.52AM.png?v=1657898381"},{"product_id":"m-series-elastic-headband-accessory-standard","title":"M-Series Comfort Headband","description":"\u003cp\u003eDesigned for all-day wear in situations not requiring alternative head protection, the Vuzix Comfort Headband is adjustable for a variety of head sizes and positions. Complete with rail mounts for easy attachment of the Vuzix M-Series glasses and any compatible head-mounted battery on either side, this cushioned headband keeps your smart glasses perfectly balanced and stable.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Standard","offer_id":43647313674406,"sku":"472T0A015","price":49.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/Pro-CaptureOne2175-grey.png?v=1724436104"},{"product_id":"4800mah-extended-use-power-bank","title":"4800 mAh Extended Use Power Bank","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe 4800mAh Extended Use Power Bank is designed for all-day shifts and assignments where a backup isn’t an option. Compatible with all M-Series products, it features the easy-to-use rail mounting design that supports Vuzix’ unique hot-swap capabilities, meaning you never need to interrupt your work when changing out the battery. With operating temperatures ranging from 0C\/32F to 45C\/114F, this battery is excellent for use in the freezer or on the line.\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43647324389542,"sku":"472T0A009","price":29.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/DSC_2026-Edit.jpg?v=1666652061"},{"product_id":"xanderglasses-vuzix-shield-prescription-inserts","title":"XanderGlasses Vuzix Shield® Prescription Inserts","description":"\u003cdiv data-region=\"main\" data-shogun-variant-id=\"645b9e9dd273e1011bc673f9\" data-shogun-platform-type=\"shopify\" data-shogun-page-version-id=\"645b9e9dd273e1011bc673f2\" data-shogun-page-id=\"637cf5e89da50f00d067b8c6\" data-shogun-site-id=\"85aa81c4-d7e3-4cf8-be8d-146bd5bdf5ab\" data-shogun-id=\"637cf5e89da50f00d067b8c6\" class=\"shogun-root\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"shg-c\" id=\"s-b29ffd64-2af4-4839-8f0f-9299291a103e\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"shg-rich-text shg-theme-text-content\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSingle-Vision Prescriptions Only\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDo it yourself kit to change the lenses on your Vuzix Shield smart glasses. Comes with manufactured lenses made from your prescription.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAfter you purchase your lenses, please fill out \u003ca rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/EyehubSolutions.formstack.com\/forms\/prescription\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ethis form\u003c\/a\u003e with your prescription information. \u003c\/strong\u003eOnce we receive your prescription information, we will fulfill your order. If you have any questions, please contact us \u003ca href=\"mailto:christian_powell-byars@vuzix.com\"\u003ehere\u003c\/a\u003e. \u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo learn how to install your new prescription lenses on your Shield, view our installation guide on the Vuzix Shield\u003cspan\u003e\u003ca title=\"Vuzix Shield Prescription Installation Guide\" href=\"\/pages\/shield-prescription-lens-installation-guide\"\u003e Prescription Installation Guide\u003c\/a\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/pages\/vuzix-shield-prescription-lens-installation-guide\" title=\"Vuzix Shield Prescription Installation Guide\"\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e page.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"\u003e* Prescription Kit does not come with Vuzix Shield smart glasses. Vuzix Shield smart glasses will need to be added separately.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 30px;\"\u003e* The Prescription Kit will be shipped within 4-6 weeks of your order date. The Vuzix Shield smart glasses and Prescription Kit Inserts will be shipped to you in 2 separate shipments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/pages\/prescription-measurement-guide\" title=\"Prescription Lens Installation Guide\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFind Out How To Enter Your Prescription\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44603032109222,"sku":"492T0A001","price":149.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/ShieldBlack_310afb63-44d2-4b27-be5b-6b1fe1283a9c.png?v=1701269982"},{"product_id":"z100-smart-glasses-prescription-inserts","title":"Vuzix Z100® Smart Glasses Prescription Inserts","description":"\u003cdiv data-region=\"main\" data-shogun-variant-id=\"645b9e9dd273e1011bc673f9\" data-shogun-platform-type=\"shopify\" data-shogun-page-version-id=\"645b9e9dd273e1011bc673f2\" data-shogun-page-id=\"637cf5e89da50f00d067b8c6\" data-shogun-site-id=\"85aa81c4-d7e3-4cf8-be8d-146bd5bdf5ab\" data-shogun-id=\"637cf5e89da50f00d067b8c6\" class=\"shogun-root\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"shg-c\" id=\"s-b29ffd64-2af4-4839-8f0f-9299291a103e\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"shg-rich-text shg-theme-text-content\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDo it yourself kit to change the lenses on your Vuzix Z100 smart glasses. Comes with manufactured lenses made from your prescription.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e* Prescription Kit does not come with Vuzix Z100 smart glasses. Vuzix Z100 smart glasses will need to be added separately.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 30px;\"\u003e* The Prescription Kit will be shipped within 4-6 weeks of your order date. The Vuzix Z100 smart glasses and Prescription Kit Inserts will be shipped to you in 2 separate shipments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca data-mce-fragment=\"1\" href=\"\/pages\/prescription-measurement-guide\" title=\"Prescription Lens Installation Guide\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eFind Out How To Enter Your Prescription\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44669702799526,"sku":"515T0A001","price":149.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/Z100-Untinted-Press_Release_46ce391b-b5df-4ef7-949f-f2ce8da3c4c1.png?v=1706203126"},{"product_id":"z100-usb-a-to-magnetic-charging-cable-3","title":"Vuzix Z100® USB-A to Magnetic Charging Cable, 3’","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eUSB-A to Magnetic Charging Cable is a 3 feet cable designed specifically for the Vuzix Z100® (not included).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44813613367462,"sku":"515T0A002","price":29.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/Cable3.jpg?v=1707925670"},{"product_id":"3200mah-xtreme-weather-power-bank","title":"3200mAh Xtreme Weather Power Bank","description":"\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe M-Series Xtreme Weather power bank is built to withstand the harshest workplace environments, with operating temperatures ranging from -20℃\/-4℉ to 45℃\/113℉. This lightweight battery has an IP67 rating against dust and water immersion and packs plenty of power for long assignments. Compatible with all M-Series products, it features the easy-to-use rail mounting design that supports Vuzix’ unique hot-swap capabilities, meaning you never need to interrupt your work when changing out the battery.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIncluded in the M400 Xtreme Kit.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45720908595366,"sku":"536T0A001","price":49.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/3200RotationLow-Right.2477_de65d05e-77bb-4a60-aed9-a69b3edea147.png?v=1723152057"},{"product_id":"vuzix-lx1-smart-glasses","title":"Vuzix LX1 Smart Glasses","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"elementToProof\"\u003eDesigned for field support and warehousing, Vuzix LX1 smart glasses combine rugged durability with powerful, hands-free functionality to enhance the productivity of your teams. Featuring a vibrant heads-up display, voice-activated controls, and Qualcomm® processor for device longevity, the LX1 enables workers to view pick lists, stream their view, and manage workflows without breaking stride. With a -20°C operation rating and a full-shift high capacity battery, the LX1 is built to withstand the harshest conditions.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLX1 Smart Glasses (-20℃\/-4℉ to 45℃\/113℉ rated)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e7000 mAh long-shift clip in battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeadband with easy release mounting system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable multi-battery charging station\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable baseball cap mount\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUser manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMounting guide\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOne-year manufacturer’s warranty\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vuzix Corporation","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46574942421158,"sku":"516PVT001","price":2199.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/LX1Isometric2.jpg?v=1754321981"},{"product_id":"remote-assist-kit","title":"Remote Assist Kit - M400","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eEmpower frontline and field workers with hands-free remote assistance using the Vuzix Remote Assist Kit. Designed for real-world environments, this turnkey solution enables workers to securely share their point of view with remote experts—improving speed, accuracy, and first-time fix rates. With a connection to your favorite collaboration platform, and a rugged, field-ready kit, teams can deploy quickly and start collaborating immediately. Each kit includes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eM400 Smart Glasses\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4800 mAh Power Bank\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeadband Mount\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBall Cap Mounts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB-C Viewer Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB-A to USB-C Charging Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCustom Hard Case\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManuals\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003ePre-loaded software to connect with Microsoft Teams and Zoom\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vuzix Corporation","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":56156492431526,"sku":"472T00033","price":1699.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/DSC00151-smaller.png?v=1770667008"},{"product_id":"remote-assist-kit-lx1","title":"Remote Assist Kit - LX1","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eEmpower frontline and field workers with hands-free remote assistance using the Vuzix Remote Assist Kit. Designed for real-world environments, this turnkey solution enables workers to securely share their point of view with remote experts—improving speed, accuracy, and first-time fix rates. \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eWith a connection to your favorite collaboration platform, and a rugged, field-ready kit, teams can deploy quickly and start collaborating immediately. Each kit includes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e LX1 Smart Glasses\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e7000 mAh Battery Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeadband Mount\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBump Cap Mounts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB-A to USB-C Charging Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCustom Hard Case\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVuzix Bump Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003ePre-loaded software to connect with Microsoft Teams and Zoom\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vuzix Corporation","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":56158888853670,"sku":"516T00003","price":2099.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/LX1Isometric2_47e5a8e1-449b-44d2-a192-1821a7c74b1b.jpg?v=1770666954"},{"product_id":"bump-cap","title":"LX1 Bump Cap","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe Vuzix bump cap is a lightweight, comfortable head protection solution designed for environments where minor bumps and scrapes are a risk, but a full hard hat isn’t required. Featuring a durable inner shell and a stylish outer cap, it blends safety with everyday wearability. Compatible with Vuzix M400 and LX1 hat-clip mounts, the bump cap is ideal for warehouses, maintenance work, and low-risk industrial settings.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix Corporation","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":56389759107238,"sku":"516T0A013","price":49.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/DSC00269.jpg?v=1776347602"},{"product_id":"lx1-7ah-battery-pack","title":"LX1 Long-Shift Power Bank","description":"\u003cdiv aria-setsize=\"-1\" id=\"message-list_1776450854.717129\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv aria-roledescription=\"message\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eThe LX1 Long-Shift 7000 mAh battery Power Bank is engineered to keep your team running even in harsh conditions. Designed for durability, it performs reliably in extreme temperatures ranging from -20°C (-4°F) to 45°C (113°F). It features a convenient slide-and-snap mounting system for quick, secure attachment to your LX1 smart glasses. Delivering dependable, all-shift power, it’s the ideal solution for warehouse teams and field technicians who need uninterrupted performance wherever the job takes them.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Vuzix Corporation","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":56389773492390,"sku":"516T0A001","price":119.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/DSC00370_c24e3a9f-de05-4b42-abf8-87c858b9977b.jpg?v=1776347790"},{"product_id":"lx1-4-bank-charger-cradle","title":"LX1 Charger Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg\u003e\u003cimg\u003e\u003cimg\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eKeep your team powered for the day with this high-efficiency multi-charger for the Vuzix LX1 7000 mAh battery. Capable of charging up to four batteries simultaneously, each charging slot features a clear LED light indicator, so you always know when batteries are ready for use. This reliable charging solution ensures your devices stay operational throughout the workday.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncludes 4 bank charger, AC\/DC adapter, AC power cord (115V 60HZ Type A), and user manual.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe rated charger input is 12VDC 4A, output is 4.2VDC 2A.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe charger must be used with included Vuzix approved UL Listed AC adapter model ADP-48GR.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vuzix Corporation","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":56409393037478,"sku":"516T0A020","price":199.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/DSC00380.jpg?v=1776348078"},{"product_id":"lx1-hat-mount","title":"LX1 Hat Mount","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eLX1 Hat Mount Clips are designed for all-day comfort. They easily attach to most baseball caps, visors, and safety bump caps, providing a secure and stable mounting solution for LX1 Smart Glasses.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003eBuilt for versatility, the clips feature a lightweight, low-profile design that maintains balance while keeping your device firmly in place during active use. The mounting system allows for smooth positioning and adjustment, so users can quickly adapt their setup for optimal viewing.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix Corporation","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":56433622089894,"sku":"516T0A004","price":14.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/DSC00365.jpg?v=1777651671"},{"product_id":"in-development","title":"In Development","description":"","brand":"Vuzix Corporation","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":56754909642918,"sku":null,"price":0.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/individuals-shield_copy_4b4f3bf6-519f-4941-9fe0-936235dc2d97.png?v=1772741969"}],"url":"https:\/\/www.vuzix.com\/collections\/all.oembed","provider":"Vuzix Corporation","version":"1.0","type":"link"}